{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"rock_lead","model_identifier":"rock_lead","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# rock_lead\n\nLead node: grey-blue rock with dull silvery lumps.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -43..53, y 0..39, z -34..30 units (2.70 x 1.10 x 1.80 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 128 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 22.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 96 x 39 x 64 (w x h x d), centred at x 5, z -2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): untouched node; the child group `companion` is the paler silver-grey rock that often sits beside it (hide it if the game places silver separately)\n- `depleted`: mined out: smaller broken chunks and gravel\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck (both sets) |\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"rock0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-28.0,0.0,-22.0],"to":[28.0,32.0,22.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[56.0,0.0,112.0,32.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,44.0,44.0,76.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[56.0,0.0,112.0,32.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,44.0,44.0,76.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,56.0,44.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,56.0,44.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"56f51dad-7926-5c2a-bed1-5d3c9c189e62"},{"name":"rock0_cap","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-17.92,